---
layout: base.njk
title: Deadline digest
permalink: /digest/
description: A free email digest of upcoming conference submission deadlines in your fields.
---
{% from "fieldpicker.njk" import fieldpicker %}
<section class="wrap page narrow">
  <h1>Deadline digest</h1>
  <p class="lede">A free, occasional email listing calls for submissions that close soon in the fields you choose. No tracking pixels, and you can unsubscribe in one click.</p>
  <div class="note"><strong>Coming soon.</strong> Join the list now and we'll send the first issue when the digest launches. In the meantime, subscribe to the <a href="/deadlines.ics">deadlines calendar</a> or the <a href="/deadlines.xml">RSS feed</a>.</div>
  <form class="form js-form" method="post" action="{{ site.forms.digest }}" data-required-group="digest_fields">
    <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Digest signup">
    <div class="row"><label for="d-email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label><input id="d-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email"></div>
    {{ fieldpicker("digest_fields", "Fields you follow", true) }}
    <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required> Email me the deadline digest. I can unsubscribe at any time.</label>
    {% include "formnotice.njk" %}
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Join the list</button>
  </form>
</section>
<script src="/assets/forms.js" defer></script>
